    "body": "The work exceeds effort:medium. It needs new behavior in two crates.\n\nThe optional machine field belongs in camcraft-post. The Machine type is in crates/post/src/machine/def.rs. The reader is parse_mch_with in crates/post/src/machine/parse.rs.\n\nThe arrow, label, switch, and display cache belong in camcraft-ui. The current envelope_lines function builds the envelope lines. overlay_labels draws the text. The view_menu function holds the envelope switch.\n\nThe app machine API already exports the post machine API. No new app API appears necessary.\n\nThe file overlap check found PR #2554 in the machine files, including parse_mch_with. It also found PRs #2786, #2773, #2764, #2737, #2678, #2662, and #2149 in UI state files. Check the exact overlap and stack rules before implementation.\n\nI raised the effort label to high, as the work-issue skill requires. I did not claim the issue. I made no code changes. I created no branch or worktree. I ran no tests.\n",
